3334 0 obj<</A<</BBox[54.119999 369.68 365.519999 611.33]/O/Layout/Placement/Block>>/Alt(A screenshot of the GUI of the Solitaire application in action. At the top left there is a hidden card with the label DeckŽ and to its right a Jack of Hearts with the label Discard PileŽ. At the top right there are four rectangles jointly labeled Foundation PilesŽ. Two of the rectangles contain cards, a Three of Hearts and an Ace of Clubs. At the bottom, there are seven piles of cards with cards organized by fanning downwards, overlapping except for a small length at the top. This part is labeled TableauŽ. Cards in these piles fan downwards in decreasing rank and alternate in the color of their suit, black/red.\n␀)/K 0/P 736 0 R/Pg 716 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj
